$913     EQU   128                     913 abend occurred               00058600
$PWUPD   EQU   64                      Password updated                 00058700
$DFTUPD  EQU   32                      Default group updated            00058800
$OSCHG   EQU   16                      OPERATIONS and/or SPECIAL updt   00058900
